PRALAYADARSHI
PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD)
SIH Problem Statement 26192
Flash Flood Prediction System for Hilly Regions using Multi-Source Data

============================================================
1. PRODUCT OVERVIEW
============================================================

Product Name:
PRALAYADARSHI

Product Type:
Software-based Hyperlocal Disaster Prediction and Decision
Support System

Target Problem:
Flash floods and landslides in hilly regions often have very
short warning times. Existing warning mechanisms may provide
broad-area information but do not sufficiently translate
multiple local risk signals into village/ward-level actionable
decisions.

Core Product Goal:
Integrate rainfall, soil moisture, slope/terrain, historical
disaster information and real-time IoT inputs to generate
hyperlocal risk assessments and support timely evacuation.

CORE USP:
COMPOUND RISK -> LEAD TIME -> ACTION

PRALAYADARSHI should not be positioned simply as an
"AI flood prediction dashboard."

It should be positioned as:

"A hyperlocal compound-risk and evacuation intelligence system
that converts multiple environmental signals into village-level
risk, estimated lead time and actionable evacuation decisions."


